  },
  {
   "type": "bullets",
   "md": "- Food taken into the body goes through 5 different stages during its passage through the alimentary canal\n\n  - One of these is chemical digestion\n- **Chemical digestion** is the breakdown of large, insoluble molecules into small, soluble molecules\n- The role of chemical digestion is to produce small soluble molecules that can be absorbed"
